1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,328
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,328 --> 00:00:04,515
Your AI agents are only
as good as what they know.

3
00:00:04,515 --> 00:00:08,721
In this lesson, we'll build your
knowledge base from your website,

4
00:00:08,721 --> 00:00:12,417
your documents and your FAQs,
so every answer is accurate.

5
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:15,814
Go to AI Agents, then Knowledge Base.

6
00:00:15,814 --> 00:00:21,456
Bloom Dental has one knowledge base, and
both the front desk chatbot and the Voice

7
00:00:21,456 --> 00:00:23,039
AI receptionist use it.

8
00:00:23,039 --> 00:00:26,135
Update it once, and
every agent gets smarter.

9
00:00:26,986 --> 00:00:30,595
Everything it knows comes from
these sources: the website,

10
00:00:30,595 --> 00:00:34,640
a list of frequently asked questions,
and an uploaded price list.

11
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:39,308
Each one shows its training status, so
you can see what the AI has learned.

12
00:00:40,156 --> 00:00:43,048
To teach it something
new, click Add source.

13
00:00:43,048 --> 00:00:46,203
You can crawl web pages,
add FAQs, upload files,

14
00:00:46,203 --> 00:00:48,569
or type information in as rich text.

15
00:00:48,569 --> 00:00:53,827
Rich text is handy for things that aren't
on your website yet, like a new offer.

16
00:00:53,827 --> 00:00:55,996
Let's start with the web crawler.

17
00:00:56,845 --> 00:00:59,162
Enter the address you want to crawl.

18
00:00:59,162 --> 00:01:02,251
Bloom has new blog posts,
so we'll add the blog.

19
00:01:02,251 --> 00:01:07,014
Then choose how much to crawl: just
this page, every page under this path,

20
00:01:07,014 --> 00:01:08,301
or the whole domain.

21
00:01:08,301 --> 00:01:11,004
All pages under this path is perfect here.

22
00:01:11,856 --> 00:01:13,196
Click Start crawling.

23
00:01:13,196 --> 00:01:15,685
Kyntlo finds every page under the blog.

24
00:01:15,685 --> 00:01:20,790
Untick any you don't want the AI to learn
from, then click Train selected pages.

25
00:01:21,643 --> 00:01:24,580
The blog appears in your
list, marked Training.

26
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:27,018
After a moment, it switches to Trained.

27
00:01:27,018 --> 00:01:30,767
If you change your website
later, click the re-train button,

28
00:01:30,767 --> 00:01:33,580
so your AI always has
the latest information.

29
00:01:34,431 --> 00:01:35,153
Next, FAQs.

30
00:01:35,153 --> 00:01:36,993
Click Add source, then FAQs.

31
00:01:36,993 --> 00:01:41,787
Type the question the way customers
ask it: "Do you offer payment plans?"

32
00:01:41,787 --> 00:01:45,137
Then write the answer
exactly as you want it given.

33
00:01:46,605 --> 00:01:47,153
Save it.

34
00:01:47,153 --> 00:01:52,706
FAQs are the most reliable source, because
the AI uses your answer word for word.

35
00:01:52,706 --> 00:01:57,780
Use them for prices, policies and
anything you never want the AI to guess.

36
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:02,099
Keep each answer short, and update
it whenever a price changes.

37
00:02:02,948 --> 00:02:04,240
Finally, documents.

38
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:08,797
Click Add source, then File upload,
and drop in a PDF or Word file.

39
00:02:08,797 --> 00:02:11,585
Here's Bloom's whitening aftercare guide.

40
00:02:11,585 --> 00:02:15,733
Click Upload and train, and it's
added to the knowledge base.

41
00:02:16,584 --> 00:02:18,638
Now let's check that it worked.

42
00:02:18,638 --> 00:02:21,619
Open Conversation AI,
and the front desk bot.

43
00:02:21,619 --> 00:02:24,467
In the test panel, ask
about payment plans.

44
00:02:24,467 --> 00:02:27,448
The bot answers using
the FAQ you just added.

45
00:02:27,448 --> 00:02:30,296
And if it can't find
an answer, it says so,

46
00:02:30,296 --> 00:02:33,476
and hands over to your
team instead of guessing.

47
00:02:34,327 --> 00:02:35,451
Here's a pro tip.

48
00:02:35,451 --> 00:02:38,758
Once a week, read your
bot's conversation history.

49
00:02:38,758 --> 00:02:44,115
Any question it couldn't answer, or passed
to your team, should become a new FAQ.

50
00:02:44,115 --> 00:02:46,695
Your AI gets smarter every single week.

51
00:02:47,549 --> 00:02:50,233
Your AI now knows your
business inside out.

52
00:02:50,233 --> 00:02:52,855
In the next lesson, we'll give it a voice,

53
00:02:52,855 --> 00:02:56,225
and set up an AI receptionist
that answers your phone.

54
00:02:56,225 --> 00:02:57,099
See you there.
